#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping – Weight Based Flexible Table Rate Shipping for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WowShipping – Expédition flexible basée sur le poids pour WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping allows store owners to define flexible shipping rates based on conditions like weight, destination, price, item count etc."
msgstr "WowShipping permet aux propriétaires de magasins de définir des tarifs d'expédition flexibles en fonction de conditions telles que le poids, la destination, le prix, le nombre d'articles, etc."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "WPXPO"
msgstr "WPXPO"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"
msgstr "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"

